			title="Object Special States";
			description="- Untick ""Enable Simulation"" where possible." \n "- Tick ""Simple Object"" where possible." \n "- Untick ""Enable Damage"" Where possible" \n "- Turn on 'Local Only' when possible" \n "" \n "Note that ""Simple Objects"", ""Unsimulated"" objects and ""Local Only"" objects will not allow you to open doors/shoot out windows. Be careful what you do this with. If you want it to be interactable, leave it's simulation turned on. Eg: The little hut next to the camo net. This has simulation turned on so you will be able to enter it. ";
			id=176;
		};
