			description="These obstacles/defences can be either blown up by Echo or can be torn down manually with an entrenching tool. Both options are accessed the same way by using ACE interact on the middle of the obstable. " \n "" \n "To set up the obstacles so they can be removed/blown up;" \n "" \n "- Place the object and set it's attributes (Keep damage and simulation turned on)" \n "- Place the script into the objects init" \n "[this] execVM ""actions\echo\clearing\clearObstacle.sqf"";" \n "- Done!" \n "" \n "NOTE: Any objects that do not have this script in the init, will not be able to be destroyed. The script is fairly lightweight so you can create large obstacle belts, but I wouldn't place it on obstacles that have no chance of ASOT running into them.  " \n "";
			id=4333;
		};
