			title="Booby Traps";
			description="This is a simple booby trap that uses the MRH search feature." \n "" \n "- You need to place a crate or object that will be searched and name it. Eg: crate" \n "" \n "- Then place an explosive of some kind with a variable name as well. Eg: charge" \n "Also make the explosive invisible so the players don't see it. (Optional) " \n "" \n "- Then set the crate or object search settings in it's attributes and add the following to the 'code to run when object is found' section. " \n "" \n "charge setDamage 1;" \n "deleteVehicle crate;" \n "" \n "- This will set the charge to zero health (detonate) and will delete the crate as if it has been blown up. ";
			id=9728;
		};
