			description="- These are some of the airframes that Hotel could use depending on the mission/campaign. Be aware of firepower levels and the ability that the airframes provide to Hotel. " \n "" \n "Eg: An armed blackfish will mean their CAS bird and Golf's arty would be removed to balance the mission. " \n "" \n "- These are examples of aircraft they could use, not a indication of what they must use or that you can only use these airframes. If you're unsure if an aircraft would be suitable, ask in the J2 channel. ";
